<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>CSUCampusCraft 管理端</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; color: #1c312a; background: #f5f8f4; font: 1rem/1.6 system-ui, sans-serif; }
        main { max-width: 44rem; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1.25rem; }
        h1 { margin-block: .25rem; }
        section { margin-top: 1.75rem; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #d3dfd2; background: white; }
        section h2 { margin-top: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body data-csucampuscraft-app="admin">
<main>
    <header>
        <small>校园文创商城 · 工程初始化</small>
        <h1>CSUCampusCraft 管理端</h1>
        <p>CSUCampusCraft 管理端工程已接入共享商品分类。当前展示数据库中的一级主题。</p>
    </header>
    <section aria-labelledby="themes-heading">
        <h2 id="themes-heading">校园主题</h2>
        <p data-theme-count="5">
            共 <span>5</span> 个一级主题
        </p>
        
        <ul>
            <li data-theme-code="LANDMARK">本轮联通测试</li>
            <li data-theme-code="COLLEGE">学院风采</li>
            <li data-theme-code="CLUB">社团活动</li>
            <li data-theme-code="SPORTS">校园运动</li>
            <li data-theme-code="GRADUATION">毕业纪念</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
